{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSwitchItem"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Layouts","anchor":"Layouts","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component can be rendered as two different layouts:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the component has a leading indicator, a label and optional texts, and an optional trailing decorative icon","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"inverse"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": like the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" layout but with a trailing switch indicator and a leading optional decorative icon","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Indicator states","anchor":"Indicator-states","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch indicator has two available states set as a boolean property that determines whether the toggle is on or off."}]},{"text":"Particular cases","anchor":"Particular-cases","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look and feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In that case if the component displayed an icon, this icon will be replaced automatically by an error icon."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be in read only mode, i.e. the user cannot interact with the component yet but this component must not be considered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as disabled."}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and optional texts and a custom switch trait."}]},{"text":"Forbidden by design","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a read only component.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both a read only and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]}]},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var isOn: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    MISOSwitchItem(LocalizedStringKey(\"notifications_setting\"), bundle: Bundle.module, isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but in read only mode (user cannot interact yet, but not disabled).","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label and a description text.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, description: \"The Beatles\")","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a label, a description and a tinted icon.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a raw (non-tinted) image.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"il_someImage\"), renderingMode: .original),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ Flip the icon for RTL layouts using MISOImage.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","                                   flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ If on error, add an error message to help user understand the error context","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   isError: true,","                   errorText: \"Something wrong\",","                   hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but disabled.","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\", isOn: $isOn)","        .disabled(true)","","    \/\/ Never disable a read only or an error-related switch as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error","    MISOSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can only be used for error messages."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Version","type":"aside"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.14.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Switch item is a UI element that allows to toggle between two states, typically “On” and “Off”, and used to enable or disable features, options or settings.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Switch Item covers a wider range of contexts by allowing to toggle the visibility of additional text labels and icon assets.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"MISOSwitchItem","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSwitchItem"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOSwitchItemV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSwitchItem"}],"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-1lrtn","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-88707","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:tableName:bundle:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-2u8vt","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSwitchItem\/init(_:tableName:bundle:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-66et1"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties